OL,3,GNEWSAParading, policing and power
OL,4,Asharing collide amid Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitics in Northern Ireland is often
OL,7,Faccused of going nowhere fast but right
OL,8,Fnow it more resembles a time warp
OL,9,Ftaking us back three decades.
OL,11,FDivisions that had been dormant over
OL,12,FDrumcree flowed angrily again between
OL,13,Fthe parties over the weekend, spilling
OL,14,Fover into Monday when MLAs returned to
OL,15,Fthe chamber.
OL,17,FLess than 24 hours after the secretary
OL,18,Fof state called on Stormont's leaders
OL,19,Fto "double down on compromise", what
OL,20,Funfolded in the assembly was all double
OL,21,Fdown, no compromise.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
