OL,3,GNEWSAParading, policing and power
OL,4,Asharing collide amid Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FTempers and emotions flared - despite a
OL,7,Fwarning from the Speaker, Edwin Poots,
OL,8,Fto mind their manners - amid shouting
OL,9,Facross the packed benches.
